# Track project.json so a fresh clone is linked to `nimble-web` (the project that
# actually serves nimble.heyitsmejosh.com). It previously drifted to a stray project
# named `web`, and `vercel --prod` silently deployed to the wrong place.
# Contents-glob + negation: git cannot re-include a file inside an excluded directory.
.vercel/*
!.vercel/project.json
